WEBVTT

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.488
Hey, look! It's the Kraken.

00:00:32.294 --> 00:00:33.462
Everybody out! Now!

00:00:45.808 --> 00:00:47.935
We're trapped! Everybody back!

00:01:19.091 --> 00:01:20.092
Baby!

00:01:20.551 --> 00:01:21.760
Papa!

00:01:32.438 --> 00:01:34.148
This has to stop now!

00:01:35.315 --> 00:01:36.316
Drac, no!

00:01:50.289 --> 00:01:51.290
Dad!

00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:53.959
Mavis!

00:01:54.418 --> 00:01:57.337
Time for the immortal Dracula to die.

00:02:08.182 --> 00:02:09.183
Dad!

00:02:15.689 --> 00:02:16.690
No!

00:02:18.108 --> 00:02:19.193
Ericka!

00:02:23.447 --> 00:02:24.948
Bob! Help!

00:02:29.286 --> 00:02:30.370
Tinkles?

00:02:30.454 --> 00:02:31.538
Dennis.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.208
Oh, no. Bob is Tinkles?

00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:35.709
How did he get here?

00:02:35.793 --> 00:02:37.711
But thank goodness he did, 'cause look!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:19.962
You can't do this!

00:03:20.045 --> 00:03:21.839
You're wrong about monsters!

00:03:23.048 --> 00:03:25.634
Dracula... He saved my life.

00:03:26.009 --> 00:03:27.010
What?

00:03:27.177 --> 00:03:28.804
I'm so sorry, Drac.

00:03:29.054 --> 00:03:31.306
I was trying to kill you
this whole time,

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.017
but then I realized how wrong I was.

00:03:34.101 --> 00:03:36.144
How wrong all of this is.

00:03:37.521 --> 00:03:38.772
And then I...

00:03:39.356 --> 00:03:40.440
I Zinged.

00:03:41.942 --> 00:03:43.652
"Zing"? What's a Zing?

00:03:43.861 --> 00:03:45.112
It's a monster thing.

00:03:45.195 --> 00:03:46.572
You wouldn't understand.

00:03:46.947 --> 00:03:49.116
It's like true love.

00:03:49.408 --> 00:03:50.409
Love?

00:03:53.996 --> 00:03:56.456
Well, I guess the legacy ends with me.

00:03:56.707 --> 00:03:57.875
That's an awkward ending.

00:03:58.625 --> 00:03:59.626
Nope!

00:03:59.751 --> 00:04:02.421
It's time to start a new legacy.

00:04:03.463 --> 00:04:06.049
A monster-human legacy.

00:04:07.134 --> 00:04:08.135
No!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.437
Drac! Van Helsing's beats are
controlling the giant octopus thingy.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.107
If there's one thing I hate,
it's an evil DJ.

00:04:22.774 --> 00:04:25.444
We need positive energy!

00:04:31.867 --> 00:04:34.870
Get ready for a DJ battle!

00:04:35.329 --> 00:04:37.706
You just carry
all that stuff around with you?

00:04:37.998 --> 00:04:41.001
Once a bar mitzvah DJ,
always a bar mitzvah DJ.

00:04:41.251 --> 00:04:45.005
We're gonna use good music
to defeat his evil music.

00:04:45.088 --> 00:04:47.549
-What?
-Trust me, I know the tunes,

00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:49.426
but you've got the power.

00:04:49.509 --> 00:04:51.219
All right. Okay.

00:04:51.553 --> 00:04:54.097
Opening song needs to be off the shizak.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.516
Got it. Play this!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:03.315
I'm picking up good vibrations

00:05:03.398 --> 00:05:06.318
She's giving me excitations

00:05:06.401 --> 00:05:08.695
-Good
-I'm picking up

00:05:08.779 --> 00:05:10.405
Good vibrations

00:05:10.489 --> 00:05:12.032
She's giving me

00:05:12.115 --> 00:05:13.492
Excitations

00:05:13.575 --> 00:05:15.285
Good, good, good

00:05:15.369 --> 00:05:16.745
Good vibrations

00:05:16.828 --> 00:05:17.996
She's giving me...

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.831
What is that noise?

00:05:19.915 --> 00:05:22.626
I'm picking up good vibrations

00:05:22.709 --> 00:05:24.294
She's giving me excitations

00:05:24.378 --> 00:05:25.796
I like this one.

00:05:25.879 --> 00:05:27.255
This feels good.

00:05:27.673 --> 00:05:29.675
Good vibrations

00:05:29.758 --> 00:05:30.926
The fool.

00:05:56.868 --> 00:05:58.745
His music is too powerful!

00:05:58.829 --> 00:06:00.956
We're gonna need something
even more positive.

00:06:01.248 --> 00:06:02.332
Now, Drac!

00:06:10.882 --> 00:06:12.676
So don't worry

00:06:14.261 --> 00:06:15.470
Be happy

00:06:15.554 --> 00:06:16.680
Don't worry

00:06:16.763 --> 00:06:19.391
-Really?
-It has a nice message.

00:06:23.186 --> 00:06:24.521
Don't worry

00:06:26.398 --> 00:06:27.399
Be happy

00:06:29.401 --> 00:06:31.820
I've had enough of this nonsense!

